Example: \-\-encoding\-from=iso\-8859\-15
.TP
.B \-\-encoding\-to " Code"
Force internal wordlist encoding to X
.br
Example: \-\-encoding\-to=utf\-32le
.TP
.B \-\-debug\-mode " Num"
Defines the debug mode, needs rules or a feed
.br
Example: \-\-debug\-mode=4
.TP
.B \-\-debug\-file " File"
Output file for debugging rules
.br
Example: \-\-debug\-file=good.log
.TP
.B \-\-induction\-dir " Dir"
Specify the induction directory to use for loopback
.br
Example: \-\-induction=inducts
.TP
.B \-\-outfile\-check\-dir " Dir"
Specify the directory to monitor 3rd party outfiles
.br
