.TP
.B \-B, \-\-benchmark\-pure
Run benchmark of selected hash\-modes, pure kernels
.TP
.B \-\-benchmark\-all
Run benchmark of all hash\-modes (requires \-b)
.TP
.B \-\-benchmark\-json
Enable JSON format for benchmark output
.TP
.B \-\-benchmark\-min " Num"
Set benchmark min hash\-mode (requires \-b)
